      "statement": "The main agent's default tool set excludes the built-in grep (DEEP_AGENT_EXCLUDED_TOOLS), and stop-summary mode additionally strips the mutating built-ins delete, edit_file, execute, task, and write_file (STOP_SUMMARY_EXCLUDED_TOOLS).",
