      "statement": "Plan mode is enforced by PlanModeMiddleware using PLAN_MODE_EXCLUDED_TOOLS; it is installed unconditionally and is state-aware, so it restricts mutating tools even after a mid-run enter_plan_mode call, not only when a run starts in plan mode.",
